Third iteration of Nervous Grid. A series of explorations on generative grids. Each mint generates a nervous grid that varies according to different randomised parameters:
Number of columns (10 to 80);
Vertical velocity of each line (0.1 to 0.9);
Number of lines on each columns (1 to 50);
Weight of each line;
Hue and Saturation.
